---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Popular Acupressure Points" description="Browse our complete collection of acupressure points organized by meridian and body region. Each point includes precise location guides, health benefits, stimulation techniques, and safety tips.">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 lg:px-6"><h1 class="mb-4">Popular Acupressure Points</h1><p class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 text-lg mb-8">Browse our complete collection of acupressure points. Each point includes detailed location guidance, benefits, how-to instructions, and safety information.</p>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <a href="/points/li4-hegu-acupressure-point" class="rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-5 transition-all hover:border-emerald-300 dark:border-stone-700 dark:bg-stone-900"><h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">LI4 (Hegu) - Union Valley</h3><p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-1">Pain relief, headaches, immune support</p></a>
      <a href="/points/pc6-neiguan-acupressure-point" class="rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-5 transition-all hover:border-emerald-300 dark:border-stone-700 dark:bg-stone-900"><h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">PC6 (Neiguan) - Inner Pass</h3><p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-1">Nausea, anxiety, motion sickness</p></a>
